{1 = 1-2}
11.	Say to my lord: this is what @wPN{Aradŋu}, 
12.	your servant, says: 

{3 = 3-8}
33.	You instructed me, as I was taking the direct route to @wGN{Subir}, 
34.	to secure your provincial taxes, 
35.	to inform myself precisely as to the state of the territory, 
36.	and to ensure its obedience by taking counsel with (?) @wPN{Apillaša}, 
37.	the 'Sage of the Assembly', 
38.	so that he could thus return the people of @wGN{Subir} to their customary way of speaking (?). 

{9 = 9-11}
99.	But when I arrived at the palace gate, no one enquired after the well-being of my lord. 
910.	No one rose from their seat before me, or bowed down. 
911.	@vart[t3101.v1,t3101.v1]{@varn{1 ms. adds:} They intimidated me. } 

{12 = 12-18}
