1213.	your wayside hostel where carding-combs (?) and lances inlaid with gold, 
1214.	silver, cornelian and lapis lazuli have been set up, 
1215.	covers an area of one hectare! 
1216.	@wPN{Apillaša} himself is decked out in @varh[t3101.v4]{gold and lapis lazuli } @vart[t3101.v5,t3101.v4]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} lapis lazuli, gold, silver and cornelian }, and he sits on a raised throne furnished with a rich raiment. 
1217.	His feet rest upon a golden footstool. 
1218.	He would not remove his feet in my presence! 

{19 = 19-21}
1919.	To his right and left he had …… soldiers (?) stationed, five thousand at each side. 
1920.	He placed at their disposal six fattened oxen and @varh[t3101.v6]{60 } @vart[t3101.v7,t3101.v6]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} 20 } fattened @varh[t3101.v8]{sheep } @vart[t3101.v9,t3101.v8]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} rams } for a meal. 
1921.	He assumed the right to perform my lord's lustration rites. 

{22 = 22-25}
2222.	After a close interrogation at the gate, nobody even bade me enter. 
2223.	When I finally entered, someone brought me a throne with studs plated with red gold and told me: 
2224.	@q[someone,Aradju]{“Sit down!”} I replied: 
2225.	@q[Aradju,someone]{“I am here to present the instructions of my king. Therefore I will not sit down!"”} 

